\description{
An \link[R6:R6Class]{R6::R6Class} component providing stateful data normalization and
inverse transformation (\verb{$fit()}, \verb{$transform()}, \verb{$inverse()}, and
\verb{$fit_transform()}) for numeric vectors and matrices (applied column-wise
